---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="[data]storm in pictures" description="[data]storm in pictures - readysaltedcode story">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/stories">Stories</a>
      </nav>
      <h1>[data]storm in pictures</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="story-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>A selection of images from our live performance during the <a href="http://brightondigitalfestival.co.uk" target="_blank">B<strong>righton Digital Festival</strong></a> 2015 A recording of the performance is available at our sister site <a href="http://datadrivendance.org" target="_blank"><strong>datadrivendance</strong></a></p>
      <p><img src="https://www.readysaltedcode.org/images/FFFFFF-0.png?CbLzjCB81J2gEFE3k3hK2OZwUB7m7SCPggNcK7fmdQ_3U87RCMpAVIbXTEzyVOXaeA5Nxxx5zg57dBrFCJmHRGJo24IMrxvinLSx0BEj4w=s1024" alt="datastorm deparature" width="1024" class="alignleft size-large wp-image-1337" /></p>
      <p><img src="https://www.readysaltedcode.org/images/FFFFFF-0.png?FDQZboJ8gBEpYZErTPqGIxr4lwwWTN34zhBxq2N2pvQGhRBo7lvggMQljcAVtQ-e2q2kV1u3EKDV3R1e4LTjZdkQTYA8Tf2OGn6uwPiI=s1024" alt="datastorm" width="1024" class="alignleft size-large wp-image-1338" /></p>
      <p><img src="https://www.readysaltedcode.org/images/FFFFFF-0.png?OKUwI48tYLxmH0VhVLx7I-cNxkFgSHENtBsyriTxojqgwH6ducb_NSFHLFxu-FPgyh2VinnqXqqHUkGCyWBPvZ766lHXfzkcTcGdBjqReg=s1024" alt="datastorm forecast" width="1024" class="alignleft size-large wp-image-1340" /></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  .breadcrumb { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: #ccc; }
  .page-header h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .story-content { padding: 3rem 0; }
  .story-content .container { max-width: 800px; }
  .story-content p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .story-content img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 8px; }
  .story-content a { color: #dd3333; }
  .story-content blockquote { border-left: 4px solid #dd3333; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-style: italic; color: #555; }
  .story-content strong { font-weight: 600; }
</style>
